eshdrohi 2-https://x.com/kamaalrkhan/status/2122929439503949931?s=19\n\nFoodpharmer-https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df2M4RGOCqR/?srtk=MWg2YjFmM281eTNuOA==\n\nMP Cop-\n•https://www.instagram.com/p/Df3kBpVBaFn/?cnvx=cHA0Y2U2N3h3YTA=\n•https://x.com/gharkekalesh/status/2122735249176264741?a=IcmkmNqd_n-juBZHcVg\u0026s=19\n\nYouths Block ambulance-https://x.com/IndiaToday/status/2122584818383044801?s=20\n\n\nDISCLAIMER - IF ANY CONTENT OWNER HAS SOME ISSUES WITH MY VIDEO PLEASE SEND A MAIL OVER MY BUSINESS MAIL AND I WILL REMOVE THE VIDEO. \n\n#scout #indiasgotlatent #samayraina #msdhoni #gta6 #ashishchanchlani #sharadkapoor #news\n\nSUBMIT NEWS HERE - https://docs.google.com/forms/u/3/d/1Ye63aD3nHNBr1OzVz7ORYG2ptXqCPYGjEMqAzJ31F4E/edit\n\nFor Business purposes - businessneonman@gmail.com\n\nThanks for the news (check them out)-\n\n•\n\nConnect with me on -\n\nInstagram (IM MORE ACTIVE HERE)- https://www.instagram.com/neonman01\nTWITTER-https://twitter.com/NeonMan_01?s=09\nFacebook-https://m.facebook.com/Neonman02/\nGameplay-https://www.youtube.com/c/NoCopyrightGameplays\n\nBackground music -\nhttps://youtu.be/mEXKWV6xHME \n\nLike, share and subscrbe to my channel for more daily updates. \nBubyeee!,\n\n0:00 Scout is Scared of Losing Kaashvi!\n1:01 Latent Contestant Heartbreaking Message to Samay!\n2:34 Indian Footballers face Racism from Palestinian Players!\n4:02 MS Dhoni Emotional Message after Retirement - Owner Reveals How He Retired!\n5:02 Ronaldo’s Mother Trolls Portugal Team!\n5:50 Techno Gamerz Rejected YouTube’s GTA 6 Offer!\n6:24 GTA 6 Hype Crazy Stories!\n7:11 Avengers Doomsday Insane Hype in India!\n7:42 Ashish Chanchlani's Appeal!\n8:26 Sharad Kapoor Exposes Fake Donations!\n8:57 Dia Mirza Vs Nawazuddin?!\n9:36 Indian Box Office creates History!\n10:01 Panchayat Season 5 Announced!\n10:26 We got Deshdrohi 2 Before GTA 6?!\n10:58 Foodpharmer Angry Reply to Legal Notice by Company!\n11:43 ”Bag mie Ganja Rakho” MP Cop Thr*atens Couple of Fake Case!\n12:46 Youths Dance on Thar Roof, Blocks way for 2 Ambulances!"},"lengthSeconds":"808","ownerProfileUrl":"http://www.youtube.com/@NeonMan","externalChannelId":"UCWZtQWpe1C2AksuJ5_eCMAQ","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountries":["AD","AE","AF","AG","AI","AL","AM","AO","AQ","AR","AS","AT","AU","AW","AX","AZ","BA","BB","BD","BE","BF","BG","BH","BI","BJ","BL","BM","BN","BO","BQ","BR","BS","BT","BV","BW","BY","BZ","CA","CC","CD","CF","CG","CH","CI","CK","CL","CM","CN","CO","CR","CU","CV","CW","CX","CY","CZ","DE","DJ","DK","DM","DO","DZ","EC","EE","EG","EH","ER","ES","ET","FI","FJ","FK","FM","FO","FR","GA","GB","GD","GE","GF","GG","GH","GI","GL","GM","GN","GP","GQ","GR","GS","GT","GU","GW","GY","HK","HM","HN","HR","HT","HU","ID","IE","IL","IM","IN","IO","IQ","IR","IS","IT","JE","JM","JO","JP","KE","KG","KH","KI","KM","KN","KP","KR","KW","KY","KZ","LA","LB","LC","LI","LK","LR","LS","LT","LU","LV","LY","MA","MC","MD","ME","MF","MG","MH","MK","ML","MM","MN","MO","MP","MQ","MR","MS","MT","MU","MV","MW","MX","MY","MZ","NA","NC","NE","NF","NG","NI","NL","NO","NP","NR","NU","NZ","OM","PA","PE","PF","PG","PH","PK","PL","PM","PN","PR","PS","PT","PW","PY","QA","RE","RO","RS","RU","RW","SA","SB","SC","SD","SE","SG","SH","SI","SJ","SK","SL","SM","SN","SO","SR","SS","ST","SV","SX","SY","SZ","TC","TD","TF","TG","TH","TJ","TK","TL","TM","TN","TO","TR","TT","TV","TW","TZ","UA","UG","UM","US","UY","UZ","VA","VC","VE","VG","VI","VN","VU","WF","WS","YE","YT","ZA","ZM","ZW"],"isUnlisted":false,"hasYpcMetadata":false,"viewCount":"72022","category":"News \u0026 Politics","publishDate":"2026-11-18T06:43:26-08:00","ownerChannelName":"Neon Man","uploadDate":"2026-11-18T06:43:26-08:00","isShortsEligible":false,"externalVideoId":"o8_oxbi7uKM","likeCount":"7181","canonicalUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o8_oxbi7uKM"}},"cards":{"cardCollectionRenderer":{"cards":[{"cardRenderer":{"teaser":{"simpleCardTeaserRenderer":{"message":{"simpleText":"View corrections"},"trackingParams":"CA8Q0DYiEwi-iYnC_5GYAxX59qACHW