collections (which are curated products recommended by the creator), or when you purchase other products on the retailer's site after clicking on a product tag. YouTube may also earn a portion of these commissions.\n\nIn some regions, products may be marked as 'channel exclusive', which are listings exclusively for one or more specific YouTube channels. These products may be discounted and/or time-limited subject to the terms and conditions of the retailer.\n\nDepending on your privacy settings, YouTube might recommend videos with tagged products based on your past activity, including products that you have previously searched for on YouTube or other YouTube videos that you have watched. You can ","textColor":4279440147},{"text":"manage your recommendations","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CLACEMdVIhMI5J2Jwv-RmAMVYSKDAx39uhr0ygEEGoazyg==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/6342839?nohelpkit=1","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/6342839?nohelpkit=1","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}},{"text":" in your settings.\n\nProduct information is determined by the retailer and may change. Click on a product tag or visit the retailer's shop for more information, including product availability, pricing, description (including any relevant disclosures and warnings) and how to make a purchase. The retailer is responsible for the conditions of purchase, including but not limited to, warnings, recalls, disclaimers and usage information.\n\nYouTube is not responsible for a retailer's products or for the product information provided by retailers. YouTube is also not responsible for your activities on and purchases made from sites which are governed by the respective retailer's terms and conditions and privacy policy.\n\nYouTube may share information with our partners as set forth in our ","textColor":4279440147},{"text":"Privacy Policy","