sneonman@gmail.com\n\nThanks for the news (check them out)-\n\n•\n\nConnect with me on -\n\nInstagram (IM MORE ACTIVE HERE)-   / neonman01  \nTWITTER-https://twitter.com/NeonMan_01?s=09\nFacebook-  / neonman02  \nGameplay-   / nocopyrightgameplays  \n\nBackground music -\n   • Invading the 80s - Synthwave - Royalty Fre...   \n\nLike, share and subscrbe to my channel for more daily updates. \nBubyeee!,\n\n0:00 Scout is Scared of Losing Kaashvi!\n1:01 Latent Contestant Heartbreaking Message to Samay!\n2:34 Indian Footballers face Racism from Palestinian Players!\n4:02 MS Dhoni Emotional Message after Retirement - Owner Reveals How He Retired!\n5:02 Ronaldo’s Mother Trolls Portugal Team!\n5:50 Techno Gamerz Rejected YouTube’s GTA 6 Offer!\n6:24 GTA 6 Hype Crazy Stories!\n7:11 Avengers Doomsday Insane Hype in India!\n7:42 Ashish Chanchlani's Appeal!\n8:26 Sharad Kapoor Exposes Fake Donations!\n8:57 Dia Mirza Vs Nawazuddin?!\n9:36 Indian Box Office creates History!\n10:01 Panchayat Season 5 Announced!\n10:26 We got Deshdrohi 2 Before GTA 6?!\n10:58 Foodpharmer Angry Reply to Legal Notice by Company!\n11:43 ”Bag mie Ganja Rakho” MP Cop Thr*atens Couple of Fake Case!\n12:46 Youths Dance on Thar Roof, Blocks way for 2 Ambulances!","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":28,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIQCEM2rARgCIhMI5J2Jwv-RmAMVYSKDAx39uhr0SKPx7sXbmPrnowHKAQQahrPK","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUlxb01IYk55eDNEVGNsekt6MXJzTFdsVUNVZ3xBQnJ0NjlrQU8taEE3TEhoU2FZeC00MmdNMFFoUkVrMEFqb2JpcW53dTVfQlFTelhpWEZ6SGFUSm9ybXdOTHdISE9SOFIxWEg3Wk1ndUlqckZrYUJPalBLZHd5LW5PdldIdWk2\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FSilverston10823%2Fstatus%2F2122702080335130803%2Fvideo%2F1%3Fa%3D-RWyU2wFgNxEL3yxmUA%26s%3D08\u0026v=o8_oxbi7uKM","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUlxb0